asset:        background.svg
title:        Filmagic macOS DMG window background
author:       @XusBadia; left panel redrawn by the Filmagic contributors
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
license-file: LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE
added:        2026-10-08 by @XusBadia
notes:        Original work for this repository. Text is outlined Inter / JetBrains Mono glyph paths; in Filmagic the outlined title was changed from "FilmCraft" to "Filmagic" (Inter SemiBold, 30 px, the original letter spacing) by the Filmagic contributors. Used for the Finder window of the macOS DMG; packaging/macos/dmg/generate.py renders it to background.tiff. See packaging/macos/dmg/README.md. On 2026-11-12 (@vansyson1308) the left panel, which cropped the previous app icon, was redrawn by hand in SVG with the new icon's motif (a tilted film strip and gold four-pointed sparkles on violet); it no longer links or contains any other artwork, and the unused hatch pattern and grain filter were removed.
